Package: com.imodcommission.ersatz
Name: Ersatz
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
Version: 2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Replace any text, system-wide!
 Fork of Ersatz by Skitty, updated for roothide and extended.
 .
 Features:
 - RootHide support
 - Search bar (matches phrase and replacement)
 - Longest-phrase-first replacement order
 - Adaptive label sizing (widen first, then shrink font)
 - Per-rule app whitelist / blacklist (with app picker + search)
 - English, Traditional/Simplified Chinese, Japanese localizations
Maintainer: imod_commission
